VALUES ('e15d56be-b7f6-524e-a949-e2ca6bf973a3', '27d235ef-350f-5112-a89a-c547697d8a34', 'text', 'Vocabulary', '{"text": "## Describing Health & States\n\n**Well** — Healthy.\n_I am very well today._\n\n**Sick** — Not healthy.\n_He is feeling sick._\n\n**Tired** — Need rest.\n_I am quite tired._\n\n**Hungry** — Want food.\n_Are you hungry yet?_\n\n**Thirsty** — Want drink.\n_I am very thirsty._\n\n**Pain** — Physical hurt.\n_I have some pain._\n\n**Better** — Improvement.\n_I feel better now._\n\n**Feel** — Emotion/physical state.\n_How do you feel?_\n\n**Rest** — Relaxing.\n_You need some rest._\n\n**Doctor** — Health worker.\n_See the doctor today._\n"}', 0, NOW(), NOW())
ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING;
