VALUES ('f75ebae1-c66a-57fa-beb2-adf41632850b', 'cf8a0810-db64-503a-97de-c5853d2654d3', 'text', 'Vocabulary', '{"text": "## Ordering Food & Drinks\n\n**Like** — Used politely with\n_would\" to request. \"I would like some water._\n\n**Menu** — The list of food prices in a restaurant.\n_Can I see the menu, please?_\n\n**Coffee** — A popular hot dark drink.\n_One hot coffee, please._\n\n**Milk** — White liquid from cows.\n_Do you want milk in your tea?_\n\n**Sugar** — Sweet white crystals for drinks.\n_No sugar for me, thank you._\n\n**Bread** — Standard baked food item.\n_We need fresh bread for dinner._\n\n**Bill / Check** — The paper showing how much to pay.\n_Could I have the bill, please?_\n\n**Please** — Word used to make requests polite.\n_Bring the tea, please._\n\n**Rice** — Common grain dish.\n_I want a plate of traditional rice._\n\n**Water** — Clear liquid essential for life.\n_Give me a cold bottle of water._\n"}', 0, NOW(), NOW())
ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING;
